{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:443d204a9802265e","name":"Azrakel","source":{"id":"source:reference-443d204a9802265e","title":"Azrakel","revision":16059,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:53:35Z","sha256":"70945ab1f42b0b024107a5b5ea8cb6b3b24b8725d43082f81ffdcc344c3837c8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16059","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Azrakel&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-443d204a9802265e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Prophets of the Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Prophets_of_the_Dark_Side","referenceId":"reference:2e7d5ec2ca3829a6"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Discovered by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Emperor Palpatine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Emperor_Palpatine"},", Azrakel is spirited away to a secret facility and used as a test subject in the Emperor's Dark Side experiments. Session after session, Palpatine exposes the young man to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Force","referenceId":"reference:67fe90e919b74d0f"},", hoping to mold him into the \"Dark Warrior\" to serve his will. After several years with no real results, Palpatine abandons his work, leaving Azrakel to die in the facility. Although the Emperor sees no point to continuing the experiments, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kadann"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kadann?action=edit&redlink=1"},", the Supreme Prophet of the Dark Side, sees something in Azrakel that Palpatine does not and nurses the subject back to health. Azrakel's mind is wiped clean by the experiments, giving ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kadann"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kadann?action=edit&redlink=1"}," the perfect opportunity to create an apprentice of his own.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["After mending Azrakel's mind, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kadann"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kadann?action=edit&redlink=1"}," teaches his new pupil to hate the Emperor for what he did to him and, in turn, hate his servant ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Vader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Vader","referenceId":"reference:c167be702b56cffc"},". As time goes on, Azrakel grows to hate ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kadann"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kadann?action=edit&redlink=1"}," as well, and he cuts himself off from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Prophets of the Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Prophets_of_the_Dark_Side","referenceId":"reference:2e7d5ec2ca3829a6"}," some time before Palpatine's death. Azrakel hides himself and his dark powers from the galaxy at large by staying away from ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Core Worlds"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Core_Worlds?action=edit&redlink=1"},". He becomes a mercenary, which proves to be a lucrative career as well as a means to vent his hostility. He gives no quarter, cutting down his targets with a level of zeal that concerns even his most coldblooded employers.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Azrakel Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["From the end of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebellion Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebellion_Era"}," to the early days of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic Era"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic_Era"},", Azrakel operates mostly in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim Territories"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim_Territories?action=edit&redlink=1"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Corporate Sector"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Corporate_Sector?action=edit&redlink=1"},", and even ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wild Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wild_Space?action=edit&redlink=1"}," as a ruthless mercenary. He can be a dangerous enemy, working as a hired henchman for a powerful crime lord, or even as the primary antagonist bent on the destruction of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi Order"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi_Order"}," before it has time to rebuild after the fall of the Empire.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Azrakel Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," 6\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 4; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 9\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +4\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 18 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 17), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/